{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_034_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b8e23591e9d78360aebaedf9cc585858a9a96475ec1db8302c325df195ff1381",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f24f71fd19a27845bc43782ca069f0bf6e0ea37b0d5cab2a4851fac4ccc2e77",
      "text": "台词本读完了——！咦？\n制作人，工作还没做完吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a63ca901fac886c4f8993fc35f200ed8671908d0ed1b475db3150cd13c96d7a",
      "text": "好像还在忙呢。一直在打电话，\n一时半会儿好像还脱不开身。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5248c981f89701c5335edc2df3c1d92c179bbab92d21cf52a307166f3e55447",
      "text": "最近工作很多，稍微有点忙呢。\n不过能一直和大家在一起好开心呀～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea4698ba18d9a4066353cac4d48ac253b6c8da92f2d554eebec910ec080004c1",
      "text": "（虽然开心……但是。大家\n有在准备花音的生日吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2690bc540fccdeac49b26f84b65e601757ebeb32c7c4e272d971595cf7d0acd",
      "text": "（难道忘记了？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c304c79a6fb66437bc06f57578cc47814199b6ace4ec0230bd66bb12982d4a3",
      "text": "（……才不会。只是大家都很擅长瞒着而已吧！\n直央君的生日会也是秘密举行的嘛）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a6755aa95a81c7385da06a82adf9c46dbc001849d7aae2aa6a6e8daf1fa12d4",
      "text": "（不只是直央君，志狼君也是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f232b56fbdf55f1df52b73db7a8c4a0c795c124de81cc0f58c91000029211029",
      "text": "花音君，……没事吧？\n有哪里看不懂的地方吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2990564203a974562245b605051090e5e4b4bec355bcb24ddd265158135023b0",
      "text": "是这样吗？哪里不懂。\n要我来教你吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ca915fef6e2c5eadce47b5a54996b73320f80f7ebcc01a0511751be43480a1c",
      "text": "啊，那个，没事的！……花音\n口渴了！去拿果汁过来哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e09207d0ba2d86a12bcf939831f77f9b65bafeb8431c85195ba7157eee585e38",
      "text": "（不行不行，和直央君他们一直待在一起的话，\n就会忍不住想问生日的事了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c36c6619fd55beca5e4083ae9351cc25ca30a00cec95810b1f71637fc448f385",
      "text": "（接下来稍微一个人呆会儿吧。\n这样的话，就能忍住不问了对吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
